### Test Internal Notification Creation
POST http://localhost:3000/notifications/internal HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-secret: 269a800898ae31432abdd845059415518d4bbeea5197ff3916b122b884ef8cab

{
  "user_id": "6ac4c677c84505b3b591e52a",
  "type": "order",
  "title": "Cross-Instance Order",
  "body": "Dispatched via Instance 2 (Port 3001) -> Received on Instance 1 (Port 3000)!"
}

### Test Unauthorized (Missing or Invalid Secret)
POST http://localhost:3000/notifications/internal HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-internal-secret: invalid_secret

{
  "user_id": "6ac37dfe98d6e679075fbfe8",
  "type": "order",
  "title": "Order Placed",
  "body": "Should fail with 401"
}

### 1. Fetch Paginated Notifications + Unread Count
GET http://localhost:3000/notifications?page=1&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YWM0YzY3N2M4NDUwNWIzYjU5MWU1MmEiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3QzQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwicm9sZSI6InVzZXIiLCJpYXQiOjE3OTEyODczOTQsImV4cCI6MTc5MTI4ODI5NH0.0CSaMN2Y-MVHZKZbi7nL5wH98_Nws3hf3MfLLTMM8eo

